\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0  In Christ there is no East or West,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 In Him, no South or North;
\par But one great fellowship of love,
\par Thro'out the whole wide earth.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  In Him shall true hearts ev'ry-where
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Their high communion find;
\par His service is the golden chord,
\par Close binding all mankind.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li270\sl190\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  3.  Join hands, then, brothers of the faith,
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 Whate'er your race may be:
\par Who serves my Father as a son,
\par Is surely kin to me.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li270\sl190\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  4.  In Christ now meet both East and West,
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 In Him meet South and North;
\par All Christly souls are one in Him,
\par \pard       Thro'out the whole wide earth.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

